 "lead": "<span data-concept=\"titration-curve\">滴定曲线</span>记录样品的 <span data-concept=\"ph\">pH</span> 随加入<span data-concept=\"titrant\">滴定剂</span>而变化的情形。本节计算用<span data-concept=\"strong-base\">强碱</span>滴定<span data-concept=\"strong-acid\">强酸</span>和<span data-concept=\"weak-acid\">弱酸</span>时各个阶段的 <span data-concept=\"ph\">pH</span>，并说明如何选取与曲线相适应的<span data-concept=\"acid-base-indicators\">酸碱指示剂</span>来指示<span data-concept=\"end-point\">滴定终点</span>。",
